This is the Simpler, Production-Grade "In-Memory" Solution.
💡 The Solution Strategy
 * No Redis / No DB Table: We store the status in a simple Java In-Memory Map. This is fast and requires no configuration.
 * File Storage: We save the generated Excel/CSV files to your server's Temp Folder (java.io.tmpdir) to keep memory usage low.
 * 4-Stage Logic: The validation runs in the background and updates the status map.
 * Frontend: Simply polls the status and updates the Stepper.
